*********************************************************************************************************************

  * Function: *note map: (Macaulay2Doc)map,
  * Usage: 
        map(F,G,f)
  * Inputs:
      * F, a *note free module with labeled basis: LabeledModule,, 
      * G, a *note free module with labeled basis: LabeledModule,, 
      * f, a *note function: (Macaulay2Doc)Function,, 
