        default value null,
      * *note DegreeMap: (Macaulay2Doc)map_lpRing_cmRing_cmMatrix_rp, => ...,
        default value null,
  * Outputs:
      * a *note map of labeled modules: LabeledModuleMap,, 

Description
===========

This function produces essentially the same output as
map(Module,Module,Function), except that the output map belongs to the class
LabeledModuleMap, and thus remembers the labeled module structure of the source
and target.

+-------------------------------------+
|i1 : S=QQ[x,y,z];                    |
+-------------------------------------+
|i2 : F=labeledModule(S^3)            |
|                                     |
|      3                              |
|o2 = S                               |
|                                     |
|o2 : free S-module with labeled basis|
+-------------------------------------+
|i3 : f=map(F,F,(i,j)->(S_i)^j)       |
|                                     |
|o3 = | 1 x x2 |                      |
|     | 1 y y2 |                      |
|     | 1 z z2 |                      |
|                                     |
|             3       3               |
|o3 : Matrix S  <--- S                |
+-------------------------------------+

