pureResES1 -- computes the first map of the Eisenbud--Schreyer pure resolution of a given type
**********************************************************************************************

  * Usage: 
        pureResES1(d,kk)
  * Inputs:
      * d, a *note list: (Macaulay2Doc)List,, 
      * kk, a *note ring: (Macaulay2Doc)Ring,, 
  * *note Optional inputs: (Macaulay2Doc)using functions with optional inputs,:
      * MonSize (missing documentation) => ..., default value 32, 
  * Outputs:
      * a *note map of labeled modules: LabeledModuleMap,, 

Description
===========

Given a degree sequence $d\in \mathbb Z^{n+1}$ and a field $k$ of arbitrary
characteristic, this produces the first map of pure resolution of type d as
constructed by Eisenbud and Schreyer in Section 5 of ``Betti numbers of graded
modules and cohomology of vector bundles''.  The cokernel of this map is a
module of finite of length over a polynomial ring in $n$ variables.

The code gives an error if d is not strictly increasing with $d_0=0$.

There is an OPTION, MonSize => n (where n is 8,16, or 32). This sets the *note
MonomialSize: (Macaulay2Doc)MonomialSize, option when the base ring of
flattenedESTensor is created.



+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i1 : d={0,2,4,5};                                                            |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i2 : p=pureResES1(d,ZZ/32003)                                                |
|                                                                             |
|o2 = | x_0^2 x_0x_1 x_1^2-x_0x_2 x_0x_2 x_1x_2 x_2^2        0      0         |
|     | 0     x_0^2  x_0x_1       x_0x_1 x_1^2  x_1x_2       x_0x_2 x_1x_2    |
|     | 0     0      x_0^2        0      x_0x_1 x_1^2-x_0x_2 0      x_0x_2    |
|                                                                             |
|               ZZ          3         ZZ          10                          |
|o2 : Matrix (-----[x ..x ])  <--- (-----[x ..x ])                            |
|             32003  0   2          32003  0   2                              |
|-----------------------------------------------------------------------------|
|0      0     |                                                               |
|x_2^2  0     |                                                               |
|x_1x_2 x_2^2 |                                                               |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i3 : betti res coker p                                                       |
|                                                                             |
|            0  1  2 3                                                        |
|o3 = total: 3 10 15 8                                                        |
|         0: 3  .  . .                                                        |
|         1: . 10  . .                                                        |
|         2: .  . 15 8                                                        |
|                                                                             |
|o3 : BettiTally                                                              |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i4 : dim coker p                                                             |
|                                                                             |
|o4 = 0                                                                       |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+

