tensorComplex1 -- computes the first map of the tensor complex
**************************************************************

  * Usage: 
        tensorComplex1(f,w)
        tensorComplex1 f
  * Inputs:
      * f, a *note map of labeled modules: LabeledModuleMap,, 
      * w, a *note list: (Macaulay2Doc)List,, of ZZ
