traceMap -- produces the trace map from a ring to a free module tensored with its dual
**************************************************************************************

  * Usage: 
        traceMap F
  * Inputs:
      * F, a *note free module with labeled basis: LabeledModule,, 
  * Outputs:
      * a *note map of labeled modules: LabeledModuleMap,, 

Description
===========

If $F$ is a free labeled module, then this produces the trace map $S\to
F\otimes F^*$.

