|     | 0 |                           |
|     | 0 |                           |
|     | 0 |                           |
|     | 1 |                           |
|     | 0 |                           |
|     | 0 |                           |
|     | 0 |                           |
|     | 1 |                           |
|                                     |
|             9       1               |
|o3 : Matrix S  <--- S                |
